<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Freelas: Erro!</title>
</head>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
<link
    href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Lato:ital,wght@0,100;0,300;0,400;0,700;0,900;1,100;1,300;1,400;1,700;1,900&family=Momo+Signature&family=Trispace:wght@100..800&display=swap"
    rel="stylesheet" />
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/output.css" />

<body>
    <div class="flex min-h-screen flex-col">
        <div
            class="inset-0 min-h-screen w-full bg-[#0a131f] bg-[linear-gradient(to_right,#ffffff08_1px,transparent_1px),linear-gradient(to_bottom,#ffffff08_1px,transparent_1px)] bg-[size:32px_32px] text-[#f0e8db]/85">
            <header
                class="mb-3 w-full rounded-b-4xl bg-linear-to-t from-[#142333] to-[#0d1722] p-5 font-momo text-4xl text-[#46cca4] text-shadow-lg/30">
                Freelas</header>

            <p class="p-3 font-trispace text-3xl text-[#cc4646]">Erro
                <%=title%>:
                    <%=message%>

            </p>

            <div class="mx-4 flex flex-col gap-5 rounded-2xl bg-[#142333] px-7 py-4 font-lato text-lg shadow-sm">
                <div class="inline-flex items-center justify-between">
                    <p class="font-trispace text-2xl">Ops! parece que ocorreu um erro em nosso sistema. :/</p>
                </div>
                <p class="text-[#bdc8c0]">Caso o erro persista por favor nos contate ou mande um issue report em
                    <a class="text-[#cc4646] underline underline-offset-2 hover:opacity-85"
                        href="https://github.com/fbetarelli/FreelanceManager">nosso Github.</a>
                </p>
                <a class="text-xl text-[#46cca4] underline underline-offset-2 hover:opacity-85" href="/">Voltar ao
                    início</a>
            </div>
        </div>
        <footer class="flex w-full flex-col gap-6 bg-[#0d1722] p-6 font-lato text-sm text-[#bdc8c0]/80">
            <p>Freelas é um serviço independente criado para fins educativos e praticidade de usuários, para saber mais
                sobre o projeto acesse nossa <a class="text-[#46cca4] underline underline-offset-2 hover:opacity-85"
                    href="https://github.com/fbetarelli/FreelanceManager">página no Github.</a></p>
            <p>Freelas™ 2026 Todos os Direitos Resevados.</p>
        </footer>
    </div>
</body>

</html>